## Bridge Layer

**Purpose:** Translate subjective creative language to technical parameters.

**Trigger:** When user provides descriptors like "warm", "lush", "psychedelic", the bridge maps these to specific parameter ranges in the Technical KB.

**Authority Score:** 0.50 (Requires validation, feedback-enriched)

**Mechanism:**
1. **Pre-seeded:** Common mappings from sound design research
2. **Auto-generated:** When agent encounters unmapped concepts
3. **Feedback-enriched:** When user evaluation refines entries

**Example Bridge Entry:**
```json
{
  "category": "filter-character",
  "descriptor": "warm",
  "mappings": [
    {
      "parameter": "filter_cutoff",
      "value_range": [0.2, 0.4],
      "typical_default": 0.3,
      "confidence": 0.75,
      "source": "sound-design-kb/warm-filter",
      "why": "Lower cutoff frequencies emphasize low-mid harmonics, reducing harsh high frequency content"
    },
    {
      "parameter": "filter_resonance",
      "value_range": [0.1, 0.25],
      "typical_default": 0.15,
      "confidence": 0.70,
      "source": "sound-design-kb/warm-filter",
      "why": "Subtle resonance adds character without harsh self-oscillation"
    }
  ],
  "anti_patterns": [
    "High resonance (>0.5) with low cutoff — creates harsh whistle"
  ],
  "combinations": [
    {
      "with": "saturation",
      "result": "warm + gritty",
      "parameter_adjustments": {
        "saturation_amount": [0.3, 0.6]
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

